                                                                      <td align="left" valign="top" style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',Arial,Helvetica;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;letter-spacing:0px;color:#525252">
                                                                        <div id="m_-4509913772158722550modnew1-text0fcf211b-3247-4ae3-885d-a3b764ed46c7" width="528" style="max-width:528px">
                                                                          <p>On 8 March, Call for Code® kicked off the 2024 Global Challenge. To celebrate, we had leaders in AI, academia, and Call for Code share their excitement about this year’s challenge as part of our online Kickoff Rally.</p>
                                                                          <p>
                                                                            <br>
                                                                          </p>
                                                                          <p>During the Rally we also announced the start of the Global Challenge Kickoff Quiz. The quiz tested participants’ knowledge on the rules of the Global Challenge, and the first person to get all questions correct would win $250 USD! Thank you to all who participated! Big congratulations go to the Kickoff Quiz winner: <strong>Mohammed Abdulsalam!</strong>
                                                                          </p>
                                                                          <p>
                                                                            <br>
                                                                          </p>
                                                                          <p>If you haven’t already done so, sign up for access to the Global Challenge web site. In addition to free generative AI training and details on this year’s competition, you can watch the Kickoff replay and stay informed about additional Call for Code Quizzes and prize opportunities throughout the year.</p>
                                                                        </div>
